      {
        "id": 69349,
        "name": "jagarciao",
        "username": "jagarciao",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/{size}/2010_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-31T19:00:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't think we need more Legacy versions… but I do like the cards you mention.&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>a card where he'd get a boost that would last for some time, but fade or explode or something. &nbsp;Maybe a card you play that puts a card or two from his deck under it, then takes one out from under at the start of his turn, let him add any targets he destroys under it. &nbsp;Boost damage by 1 for each card underneath. &nbsp;As long as there are targets to destroy he could keep his damage up, but if he can't beat anyone down, then it fades each round. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>something maybe like:</p>\n<p>At the beginning of your turn, remove one card from underneath this card. If there are no cards to remove, destroy this card.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Whenever legacy destroys a target, place the target under this card.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Legacy gains +X damage dealt, where X is the number of cards underneath this card.&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A card that would let him grab a villain target with 5 or less max HP and use it as a weapon to hit other villains would be awesome, have it lose HP each time he uses it. &nbsp;Stuff that lets him go on sick little rampages through minion hordes.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is somewhat similar to the Fanatic card that destroys one target and deals that target's HP in damage to another, but for this case it could be like this:</p>\n<p>Place this card next to a villain target with HP of 5 or less.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>At the beginning of your turn deal that villain target 1 melee damage and then deal X damage to another target, where X = the first target's HP.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
