        "created_at": "2013-08-01T20:11:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How about:</p><blockquote><p>Play next to a target other than a character card, with 5 or fewer max HP. That card is considered to be blank apart from its HP. If that target is destroyed, destroy this card.</p><p>Damage that would be dealt to a hero target may be redirected to this card's target.</p><p><strong>Power:&nbsp;</strong>[Heroname] deals 1 target melee damage equal to the HP of this card's target, then deals this card's target 1 irreductible melee damage.</p></blockquote>",
